  "body": "## What changed\n\n- `xtask/src/assets.rs` (`suites_for`): the asset match reads the entry file and each module file of a suite (`suites::sources(&suites::entry(...))`). A directory suite whose child module names an asset is now selected (#923). A flat suite whose `mod x;` file names an asset is also selected. This can only add suites.\n- `xtask/src/catalog.rs` (`map_catalog`): the check uses `suites::entry(root, \"app\", \"example_catalog\")`. The flat file is still found first, so the behaviour on main does not change.\n- `xtask/src/plan.rs` (`may_run_ignored`): a directory suite (`tests/<b>/main.rs`) is read through all its module files. A `mod x;` line alone does not plan a heavy step. These still plan a heavy step: `ignore`, `include!` or `#[path` in any file, an unreadable file, a module walk error, and a declared module whose file is absent.\n- `xtask/src/suites.rs`: new `sources_and_missing`, which also counts the declared modules whose file is absent. `sources` keeps its signature.\n- A flat suite keeps the old rule: a `mod x;` line plans a heavy step. A flat walk removes about 175 heavy steps of the cut plan. That change needs its own review, so it is recorded in #3706.\n- Decision file: `docs/decisions/3186-xtask-directory-suites.md`.\n\n## Not in this PR\n\nThe `quick.rs` part of #3186 (per-source Gate maps and the `--test <suite> <submod>::` filter) is in the follow-up #3706. It needs a new pick kind in `Picks`, `describe` and `steps`. That is more than half of this work. Thus this PR says `Refs #3186`.\n\n## Readings\n\n- `cargo xtask gate release --dry-run`, heavy steps: 276 before, 275 after. The one removed step is `motion heavy: rest_adaptive` (its files hold no `ignore`). No other step changes.\n- `cargo xtask gate quick --base origin/main --dry-run`: 1 step (`xtask unit tests`), as before for an xtask-only diff.\n- `cargo xtask gate heavy --base origin/main --dry-run`: 0 steps (\"the diff reaches no heavy lane\"), as before.\n\n## Pinning tests\n\nRed before the fix (3 of 5 new fixture tests failed on origin/main code):\n- `directory_tests::selection::an_asset_named_in_a_child_module_selects_its_directory_suite`\n- `directory_tests::selection::a_catalog_change_selects_a_directory_example_catalog`\n- `directory_tests::selection::a_directory_suite_without_ignored_tests_gets_no_heavy_step`\n\nGuards that keep the safe answer (green before and after):\n- `directory_tests::selection::a_directory_suite_with_a_missing_module_file_keeps_its_heavy_step`\n- `directory_tests::selection::a_flat_suite_keeps_the_mod_line_rule`\n\nLive repo case:\n- `heavy_tests::a_directory_suite_gets_a_heavy_step_only_when_a_module_holds_an_ignore` (`crates/motion/tests/rest_adaptive`)\n\n## Quick gate (final head)\n\n- `cargo test -j 6 -p xtask -- --test-threads=6`: 302 unit tests and all integration binaries pass.\n- `cargo clippy -j 6 -p xtask --all-targets -- -D warnings`: clean.\n\n## Not exercised\n\n- No heavy lane runs. The diff is xtask only and reaches no heavy lane.\n- No real cut gate run with the smaller heavy plan.\n\nEffort: medium (not escalated).\n\nChangelog: none\nProcess change: yes\n\nRefs #3186\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
